# Question 01 : 
     Create a layout with three boxes side by side using Flexbox. The first box
    should have twice the width of the other two. Provide the HTML and CSS code
    snippets.

# Answer 01 :
    To create three boxes side by side using Flexbox, we use display: flex on the container.
    To make the first box twice the width of the other two, we use the flex property.

    HTML Code : 
        <div class="container">
            <div class="box box1">Box 1</div>
            <div class="box">Box 2</div>
            <div class="box">Box 3</div>
        </div>
    
    CSS Code : 
        .container {
             display: flex;
        }

        .box {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 5px;
            background-color: lightgray;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .box1 {
            flex: 2;
        }

