# Question 03 : 
    Write a media query that changes the background color of the body to light
    grey when the screen width is less than 600px.


# Answer 03 : 
    A media query is used in CSS to apply styles based on the screen size or device type.
    In this case, we want to change the background color of the body to light grey when the screen width is less than 600px.

    Code : 
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            body {
                background-color: lightgrey;
            }
        }
