# Question 04 : 
    Create a button that changes its background color to blue and scales up
    slightly when hovered over, using CSS transitions. Provide the HTML and CSS code
    snippets

# Answer 04 : 
    We can create a button that changes its background color to blue and slightly increases in size when hovered by using the :hover selector and transition property.

    HTML Code : 

        <button class="btn">Click Me</button>


    CSS Code :

        .btn {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: gray;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: blue;
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }


