# Question 05 : 
    Use the ::before pseudo-element to add a decorative icon before each list
    item in an unordered list with the class name ‘decorated-list’. Provide the HTML and
    CSS code snippets.

# Answer 05 : 
    The ::before pseudo-element is used in CSS to insert content before an element’s actual content.
    Here, we will add a decorative icon before each list item in an unordered list with the class decorated-list.

    HTML Code : 

        <ul class="decorated-list">
            <li>HTML</li>
            <li>CSS</li>
            <li>JavaScript</li>
        </ul> 
  
    CSS Code : 

        .decorated-list li::before {
            content: "★ ";
            color: red;
            margin-right: 5px;
        }

