# Question 06 : 
    Create a simple animation that moves a square box from left to right
    infinitely. Provide the HTML and CSS code snippets.

# Answer 06 : 
    We can create this animation using CSS @keyframes and the animation property.

    HTML Code : 
    
    <div class="box"></div>
    
    CSS Code : 

        .box {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background-color: red;
            position: relative;
            animation: moveBox 3s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes moveBox {
            from {
                left: 0;
            }
            to {
                left: 300px;
            }
        }

